# Dev image exception: Dockerfile.dev COPYs the locally pre-built bootJar from
# app/build/libs/, which the build/ exclusions above would drop from the context.
# Re-include exactly that one artifact. Prod Dockerfile builds from source and is
# unaffected (it never COPYs from app/build/).
!app/build/libs/lumie-backend.jar
